{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>19歲聲夢小花鍾柔美（Yumi）在10月30日以破格短髮新形象現身《新城勁爆頒獎禮2026》記者會，與平時的甜 …</p><p></p>\n<p>19歲聲夢小花鍾柔美（Yumi）在10月30日以破格短髮新形象現身《新城勁爆頒獎禮2026》記者會，與平時的甜美長髮造型判若兩人。她更以此造型大跳馬天佑的新歌挑戰，瞬間引發大批網民熱烈討論。這次形象大變背後的真正原因終於揭開！</p>\n<h2>鍾柔美短髮新造型現身記者會</h2>\n<p>配合大會今年「被看見」主題，一向以標誌性長髮示人的鍾柔美昨日穿上啡色外套搭配一頭俐落短髮亮相。活動期間，她與歌手馬天佑合體進行一take過唱歌挑戰，親自演繹對方的新歌《降落後就散》。這段影片在社交平台曝光後，她截然不同的破格打扮迅速成為大眾焦點，不少粉絲對這個突如其來的改變感到相當驚訝。</p>\n<h2>破格造型僅屬萬聖節主題假髮</h2>\n<p>正當外界以為她決心剪去長髮轉換風格時，真正原因很快便水落石出。據了解，由於昨日適逢萬聖節前夕，記者會特別加入了節日變裝元素，她頭上的短髮其實只是為了配合大會主題而特意佩戴的假髮。活動結束後她已經除下相關道具，證實她依然維持著大眾熟悉的青春美少女模樣，並沒有真正改變原有的長髮形象。</p>\n<h2>一直維持長髮甜美路線</h2>\n<p>參加選秀節目出身的19歲鍾柔美憑藉跳唱實力備受肯定，自出道以來一直以其標誌性的長髮及精緻五官，成功吸納大批忠實粉絲支持。這次她大膽嘗試在公開場合展現截然不同的成熟一面，確實為觀眾帶來強烈的視覺衝擊。她在社交平台上分享這段跳唱挑戰影片後，短短數小時內已經累積大量粉絲留言及轉發，片段更在多個粉絲群組中廣泛流傳。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議鍾柔美撞樣知名前輩莊思敏</h2>\n<p>這次短髮造型在網上引發不同評價，大批網民紛紛在社交平台留言發表意見。有網民在Threads發文指出她這個打扮散發出成熟韻味，直言「個樣好似莊思敏」，指出她與這位知名前輩意外撞樣。同時亦有粉絲力撐偶像願意嘗試新事物，在相關影片下方連環留言表示「萬聖節突襲好有驚喜」、「挑戰一take唱《降落後就散》好好聽」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373085712680_13487516406ae5c79340d30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373085712680_13487516406ae5c79340d30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鍾柔美以俐落短髮造型亮相，一改平日長髮甜美形象，令人眼前一亮！（圖片來源：小紅書@卡地亞）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373159184974_19115061336ae5c793e75f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 8870103.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373159184974_19115061336ae5c793e75f1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>慣咗睇Yumi長髮Look，突然換上短髮，大家紛紛留言表示認唔出！（圖片來源：IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373530510959_1779196596ae5c7978db47.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 926574.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344373530510959_1779196596ae5c7978db47.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>原來今次剪短髮係配合萬聖節變裝戴上假髮（圖片來源：IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17934437388901199_3934421496ae5c79b1399e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 5457684.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17934437388901199_3934421496ae5c79b1399e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344374329181996_1711227636ae5c79f88c64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"[image] - 8026849.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179344374329181996_1711227636ae5c79f88c64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人覺得撞樣莊思敏（圖片來源：IG@jacquelinchng）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%96%b0%e5%9f%8e%e5%8b%81%e7%88%86%e9%a0%92%e7%8d%8e%e7%a6%ae2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新城勁爆頒獎禮2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%8e%8a%e6%80%9d%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莊思敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%8d%be%e6%9f%94%e7%be%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾柔美</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3533554\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 1 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:05.325908+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1343,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:57.764626+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:57.764626+00:00","content_hash":"b2264b0694965e2565dc62936eb67c3f53e72b13236fad35ef876fbaba1bf66a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}